  "relation_review": "Reviewed the native official PDF part 2, physical pages 1-2,5-7,12,14-16. Article 91(5)-(6) covers infrastructure and approval/resettlement before acquisition, not a personal guarantee. Article 95(1) enumerates eligible classes; 95(2) adds alternative conditions only for those classes; 95(3) delegates additional cases. Article 104 covers disassembly, movement, installation and machine-line damage during these operations, not every loss; province sets rates. Article 108 enumerates support with branch-specific conditions and delegated detail, not automatic universal entitlement. Article 109(1) has explicit target groups and limits; (2)-(6) do not remove these prerequisites. Law43 changes commencement through252(1), not these articles. Approval is limited to the original-law historical period; no conclusion that these original rules alone govern2026. S06 model failure remains unchanged.",
